Experiment 1: Library Management System

Aim:
To create a Library Management System website using HTML and CSS.

Algorithm:

1. Create the basic HTML structure of the website.
2. Add a navigation menu with Home, Books, and Contact sections.
3. Display available books with their titles and details.
4. Add a book search section.
5. Create sections for issuing and returning books.
6. Add a student login and registration section.
7. Apply CSS to style the website.
8. Run the HTML file in a web browser.

Result:
The Library Management System website was successfully created using HTML and CSS.
